The Mystic Cloak	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Mystic Cloak","wikiPath":"/The_Mystic_Cloak","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Northern Felwithe","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Tolkar Parlone","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Tarnished Bronze Key","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Tarnished_Bronze_Key"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Mystic Cloak","item":"Mystic Cloak","wikiPath":"/Mystic_Cloak"}],"card":{"title":"The Mystic Cloak","lines":["Minimum Level: 30+","Classes: Enchanter, Magician, Necromancer, Wizard","Related Zones: Erudin Palace, Najena, Unrest","Related NPCs: Linara Parlone, Trilani Parlone, A priest of najena"]},"links":["Felwithe","Tolkar Parlone","Enchanter","Magician","Necromancer","Wizard","Erudin","Najena","Unrest","Linara Parlone","Trilani Parlone","A priest of najena","Mystic Cloak","Steelskin","Keepers of the Art","Bat Wings","Tarnished Bronze Key","Moosh","Guard's Keyring","A Sealed Letter","King Tearis Thex","Faydarks Champions","The Dead","Faded Cloak"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Tolkar Parlone","text":"Hail, good adventurer! I am afraid that my services are not available at the moment. I am too worried about my [daughter]."},{"npc":"Tolkar Parlone","text":"My daughter's name is Linara. I have not seen her in several months, and I fear the worst. She went off adventuring, even though I told her how dangerous it was."},{"npc":"Tolkar Parlone","text":"I do not know where she went, but I thought she mentioned something about lava. It still sends shivers down my spine just thinking about it."},{"npc":"Linara Parlone","text":"Take this letter to my father immediately, his name is Tolkar Parlone!"},{"npc":"Tolkar Parlone","text":"Oh my she did get herself into some trouble! I thank you for rescuing her my friend. Here, take this old cloak. I am afraid its power has faded, but if you bring it to my wife, she might be able to do something for you. She is currently studying in Erudin."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T06:55:42.834Z","outOfEra":false}
Feskr's Supplies	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Feskr's Supplies","wikiPath":"/Feskr's_Supplies","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Kerra Island","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Feskr Drinkmaker","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Fire Beetle Leg","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Fire_Beetle_Leg"},{"name":"Backpack","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Backpack"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Rough Leather Sack","item":"Rough Leather Sack","wikiPath":"/Rough_Leather_Sack"},{"text":"You gain experience!! (0.030%) @level 6"}],"card":{"title":"Feskr's Supplies","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Kerra Island","Related NPCs: a fire beetle"]},"links":["Kerra Island","Feskr Drinkmaker","A fire beetle","Rough Leather Sack","A venomous spikefish","Fire Beetle Leg","Backpack"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Feskr Drinkmaker","text":"Erh? If you not be here to help Feskr with his [problem] then Feskr want you to leave."},{"npc":"Feskr Drinkmaker","text":"You wish to help? Orrderrr of supplies I rrequest not arrive; ship sink. Now Feskr needs supplies. Feskr need bottle of Tunare's Finest, thunderhoof mushroom, tea leaf, and handmade backpack. Rrrr, strange items but Feskr need to sell. Feskr makes best bags. But these require best [materrrials]. You bring. Feskr give you nice bag."},{"npc":"Feskr Drinkmaker","text":"Begins with norrrmal backpack. Adventuring Supplies Merchant acrrross brrridge sells. Then needs oil of fishes from ourrr verrry own riverrr. Finished off with beetle legs to toughen up. Beetles come frrrom forrrest, but sometimes make it into village."},{"npc":"Feskr Drinkmaker","text":"Ahhh. This will help. Many Kerrans will like these. Here. Take this old bag. I have too many. Maybe it help you."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T06:55:43.925Z","outOfEra":false}
Catman Alliance	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Catman Alliance","wikiPath":"/Catman_Alliance","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"The Warrens","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Aderius Rhenar","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Coin"},{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"}],"card":{"title":"Catman Alliance","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Erudin","Related NPCs: Leraena Shelyrak"]},"links":["The Warrens","Aderius Rhenar","Erudin","Leraena Shelyrak","Faction","Rolled Up Strip of Cloth","Peace Keepers","High Council of Erudin","Heretics"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Aderius Rhenar","text":"Hail, _______. I am Aderius Rhenar, priest of Quellious and assistant to Lady Leraena. I have been fortunate to be imprisoned here with these Kejekan cat men, they are a very wise people. Are you planning on returning to Erudin soon my friend?"},{"npc":"Aderius Rhenar","text":"I have managed to prepare a message on this scrap of cloth for the priestess Leraena. It is a matter of great importance to the High Council of Erudin. Please deliver this message to her promptly. I must stay here for a while longer and converse further with my Kejekan friends."},{"npc":"Leraena Shelyrak","text":"Welcome my, child. I am Leraena Shelyrak, overseer of the Temple of Divine Light. Inside this temple, you may find the path to inner peace. Introduce yourself to each of the priests and priestesses of the temple as well as the paladins. Together we shall put an end to such disruptive influences as the [kobold shaman]."},{"npc":"Leraena Shelyrak","text":"This is important news indeed. It seems there is a tribe of cat men in the Stonebrunt Mountains that wishes to form an alliance with Erudin. I must alert the High Council of this immediately, thank you for your services."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T06:55:45.010Z","outOfEra":false}
