Solusek's Flower	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Solusek's Flower","wikiPath":"/Solusek's_Flower","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Mistmoore Castle","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Ssynthi","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Scepter","item":"Scepter","wikiPath":"/Scepter"}],"card":{"title":"Solusek's Flower","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Lesser Faydark","Related NPCs: None"]},"links":["Mistmoore Castle","Ssynthi","Lesser Faydark","Scepter","Temple Of Sol Ro","Shadowed Men","Shadowbound Armor Quests","Weeping Wand Quest"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Ssynthi","text":"I am Ssynthi, [Warder of Ro]. Would you do a simple [service] for me?"},{"npc":"Ssynthi","text":"I have renounced by ties to the shadowed men and become a follower of the one true flame, Solusek Ro. I have hopes that one day my brethren will see the errors of their ways and cease their mindless war."},{"npc":"Ssynthi","text":"The body of my true love lies within this tomb. I seek a token to remember her by - the flower which lies atop her coffin. I would get it myself, but the tomb is warded against my kind. Since I can not enter, I ask you to fetch it for me."},{"npc":"Ssynthi","text":"Thank you. Since you have done me a service with no thought of reward, I offer you this small token of my favor."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T11:03:05.348Z","outOfEra":false}
Magician Spells (Evil Version)	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Magician Spells (Evil Version)","wikiPath":"/Magician_Spells_(Evil_Version)","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"The Overthere","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Slicia J`Singe","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Spell: Boon of Immolation","item":"Spell: Boon of Immolation","wikiPath":"/Spell:_Boon_of_Immolation"},{"text":"Spell: Scintillation","item":"Spell: Scintillation","wikiPath":"/Spell:_Scintillation"},{"text":"Spell: Vocarate: Air","item":"Spell: Vocarate: Air","wikiPath":"/Spell:_Vocarate:_Air"},{"text":"Spell: Vocarate: Fire","item":"Spell: Vocarate: Fire","wikiPath":"/Spell:_Vocarate:_Fire"}],"card":{"title":"Magician Spells (Evil Version)","lines":["Minimum Level: 44","Classes: ?"]},"links":["The Overthere","Slicia J`Singe","Spell: Boon of Immolation","Spell: Scintillation","Spell: Vocarate: Air","Spell: Vocarate: Fire"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Slicia J`Singe","text":"Why is it that you have come to this place? If you are coming here in search of [magical scrolls], just get back on that so-called ship you came here on and forget everything you thought you heard."},{"npc":"Slicia J`Singe","text":"Is your hearing failing you!? Unless you [have something I need], be gone!"},{"npc":"Slicia J`Singe","text":"I must have the scrolls of Gift of Xev, Bristlebane's Bundle, Quiver of Marr, and the Scars of Sigil. If you don't have one of these, leave my sight! If you do, I think we can work up a fair trade."},{"npc":"Slicia J`Singe","text":"Here is the scroll that I promised. We have both gained much knowledge today. I hope to do business with you again soon. Farewell!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T11:03:06.452Z","outOfEra":false}
